  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "description": "Component Manifest data for the presentation components the factory actually renders. This is not a second declaration of what a component is: the template owns each component's id, version, binding roles and variants, and this records only what the template cannot express \u2014 how a component is rendered, what a build must have wired for it to render correctly, and which design tokens its own appearance depends on. Entries exist only for components that render today; a component that does not yet exist belongs here as `planned` or not at all.",
